 "nav.why":"He aha ai","foot.menu":"Kamupene","foot.explore":"Tūhura",
 "terms.t":"Ngā ture whakamahi","terms.b":"He kōrero whānui tēnei paetukutuku mō ā mātou ratonga. Ka taea te whakarerekē te ihirangi me te kore pānui, ehara i te whakatau utu, i te tuku, i te kirimana rānei, ka tuhia ā tāua mahi ki tētahi whakaaetanga tuhituhi motuhake. He tauira noa ngā wā me ngā tauira e whakaaturia ana. Ahakoa tā mātou tiaki, kāore e taea te kī kāore he hapa, ā, kāore mātou e whai kawenga mō te mate i puta i te whakawhirinaki ki ēnei kōrero. Ka whai mana te ture o Aotearoa.",
